WEBVTT

00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:12.860
The crackling fires spiral up with the wind,

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:21.200
as colossal waves crash onto a distant shore.

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:30.300
The raging mechanical god shouts,

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:40.680
as thunderclaps flow forth.

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:47.020
Chapter Ten

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:47.020
The Castle of Illusion

00:01:25.410 --> 00:01:26.410
Kuon.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:37.210
What's wrong?

00:01:46.850 --> 00:01:47.890
The air is too still.

00:01:48.220 --> 00:01:48.890
Huh?

00:02:28.770 --> 00:02:33.140
I welcome you to the Red Castle, Kuro!

00:02:33.140 --> 00:02:36.350
I am Hasegawa and I'm in charge of this facility.

00:02:37.230 --> 00:02:40.860
You might believe that this is our first meeting...

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:45.240
However, I know all about you.

00:02:45.710 --> 00:02:49.280
You're a thousand-year-old outcast.

00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:54.040
I've been very patient...

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:56.710
waiting for the day that you'd arrive here.

00:02:57.750 --> 00:03:02.170
This is almost like... love.

00:03:02.750 --> 00:03:06.680
You sure know how to keep people waiting.

00:03:06.680 --> 00:03:11.930
I was worried about what I'd do if the likes of
Arashiyama and Kagetsu had halted your progress.

00:03:11.930 --> 00:03:15.890
After all, I purposely sent Kuon to guide you here.

00:03:16.810 --> 00:03:19.810
So consider this as your punishment.

00:03:20.240 --> 00:03:23.360
Both of you can suffer a bit more.

00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:41.650
You bastard!

00:05:51.760 --> 00:05:53.050
Kuromitsu...

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:22.540
What are you doing?

00:06:29.460 --> 00:06:31.760
What in Hell's name are you doing, Kuromitsu?

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:34.130
You were watching?

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:35.680
Indeed.

00:06:36.430 --> 00:06:40.140
You saw what I just did?

00:07:03.460 --> 00:07:04.660
This is...

00:07:15.470 --> 00:07:16.590
You bastard!

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:47.580
How was it?

00:07:52.590 --> 00:07:54.460
I'd be interested to know how you felt about it.

00:07:56.090 --> 00:07:58.010
What was that just now?

00:07:58.010 --> 00:07:59.510
What are you referring to?

00:07:59.510 --> 00:08:01.890
Why do you have my dream?

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:07.730
That wasn't a dream. You don't remember?

00:08:10.650 --> 00:08:16.280
That is the only existing video we have that shows both of you together.

00:08:16.280 --> 00:08:18.240
It's from twenty years ago.

00:08:18.780 --> 00:08:20.990
Why do you have such a video?

00:08:20.990 --> 00:08:24.200
There was little in the way of entertainment back then.

00:08:24.200 --> 00:08:28.330
They filmed a manhunt once and distributed the copies,

00:08:28.330 --> 00:08:31.500
and it seems it became a popular title.

00:08:31.500 --> 00:08:35.920
After that, soldiers would always take cameras with them when they headed out.

00:08:35.920 --> 00:08:40.300
In other words, they recorded videos of themselves killing humans.

00:08:42.640 --> 00:08:44.850
You should know that, right?

00:08:50.350 --> 00:08:51.900
I get it now.

00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:53.770
I see it clearly.

00:08:54.270 --> 00:08:58.400
I'll tell you a "fact" about yourself.

00:08:58.400 --> 00:09:02.740
During your journey here, you've lost all your memories, haven't you?

00:09:02.740 --> 00:09:04.410
My journey?

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:08.660
Well, it has something to do with your unique physique.

00:09:08.660 --> 00:09:10.290
My unique physique?

00:09:10.290 --> 00:09:13.790
I refer to the fact that your appearance remains ever-youthful.

00:09:15.840 --> 00:09:17.630
Let's break this down for you.

00:09:17.630 --> 00:09:23.930
Perhaps we know more about you than you do yourself.

00:09:26.640 --> 00:09:28.430
Do you remember this man?

00:09:30.100 --> 00:09:31.940
Yokoyama Hiroaki.

00:09:32.980 --> 00:09:35.900
He was a member of the SDF's Special Ops outfit.

00:09:35.900 --> 00:09:39.110
Twenty years ago, he went MIA while on an assignment.

00:09:39.110 --> 00:09:42.450
We don't know what happened to him after that.

00:09:42.860 --> 00:09:47.950
His assignment was to pursue you and that woman.

00:09:48.540 --> 00:09:53.960
We keep records of all our soldiers' fingerprints.

00:09:54.380 --> 00:09:56.840
This is Yokoyama's fingerprint.

00:09:57.710 --> 00:10:00.670
And this one, Kuro, is yours.

00:10:04.720 --> 00:10:08.560
As you can see, it's a perfect match.

00:10:09.350 --> 00:10:13.730
The fingerprints on the weapon you threw away back then are different to the prints you have now.

00:10:14.690 --> 00:10:19.780
Meaning that, at that point, you and Yokoyama were still different people.

00:10:19.780 --> 00:10:22.200
Now, however, all your fingers...

00:10:22.660 --> 00:10:27.370
all ten of your fingerprints are the same as his.

00:10:27.370 --> 00:10:29.040
In other words, Kuro,

00:10:30.450 --> 00:10:35.330
we can only assume that you are, in fact, Hiroaki Yokoyama.

00:10:36.050 --> 00:10:39.170
At the very least, this is his body.

00:10:39.960 --> 00:10:43.340
Still, it's an amazing feat.

00:10:43.340 --> 00:10:49.600
Your DNA shows that your body has been alive for up to a thousand years.

00:10:50.470 --> 00:10:52.560
Your youthful appearance raised my suspicions,

00:10:52.560 --> 00:10:55.350
but that's what the base sequence tells us.

00:10:55.980 --> 00:10:58.190
What could this possibly mean?

00:10:59.320 --> 00:11:01.280
Meeting you here...

00:11:02.190 --> 00:11:03.700
What exactly...

00:11:03.700 --> 00:11:06.240
are you?

00:11:10.620 --> 00:11:13.080
Can you provide me with the answer?

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:15.580
You are...

00:11:15.580 --> 00:11:17.880
a monster.

00:11:19.130 --> 00:11:21.500
Ugly, yet noble.

00:11:21.500 --> 00:11:25.260
Essentially, you are supreme: a disgustingly beautiful...

00:11:26.130 --> 00:11:28.220
<i>monster</i>.

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:35.730
You see, you switch bodies every hundred years so that you can keep on living.

00:11:35.730 --> 00:11:37.690
When the body withers with old age,

00:11:37.690 --> 00:11:39.860
you simply exchange it.

00:11:44.530 --> 00:11:48.280
And every time your form changes,

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:52.540
you lose all those memories you've accumulated.

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:55.330
How pathetic.

00:12:05.380 --> 00:12:07.340
I couldn't help but tremble...

00:12:07.340 --> 00:12:11.010
when I learned of your existence twenty years ago.

00:12:11.720 --> 00:12:14.180
I couldn't choke back my curiosity!

00:12:14.810 --> 00:12:16.770
If I could perhaps combine...

00:12:16.770 --> 00:12:19.320
your sublime blood with an equally superior body,

00:12:19.320 --> 00:12:22.570
what theatrics would they create together?

00:12:22.870 --> 00:12:24.480
I want to see that.

00:12:29.240 --> 00:12:33.080
If you had a body more suited to you,

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:37.580
you might develop an unstoppable new ability!

00:12:37.580 --> 00:12:41.330
It could give birth to a superior form of life!

00:12:43.250 --> 00:12:46.800
That's why I created Kuon.

00:12:47.880 --> 00:12:53.720
I created him using a sample of your blood.

00:12:53.720 --> 00:12:58.270
He is the forty-eighth specimen who became ageless and immortal!

00:13:14.200 --> 00:13:15.450
Got it.

00:13:15.450 --> 00:13:16.620
I'll end things quickly.

00:13:19.660 --> 00:13:20.750
Hey.

00:13:21.460 --> 00:13:23.040
Long time no see!

00:13:30.010 --> 00:13:32.510
Have you really forgotten who I am?

00:13:32.510 --> 00:13:34.300
That's so cold of you.

00:13:34.300 --> 00:13:36.100
I know nothing about you.

00:13:38.100 --> 00:13:40.020
Then, let's change the subject.

00:13:40.730 --> 00:13:42.690
Don't you hate bugs?

00:13:44.310 --> 00:13:49.240
When you were a child, didn't you start wailing because a long-horned beetle bit your thumb?

00:13:49.240 --> 00:13:55.160
Isn't that why, even now, you unconsciously hide your thumb?

00:13:55.160 --> 00:13:56.910
I'm right, aren't I?

00:13:58.620 --> 00:13:59.620
Who are you?

00:14:00.870 --> 00:14:02.960
Should I tell you?

00:14:03.670 --> 00:14:06.040
My name is Kuon.

00:14:07.670 --> 00:14:10.010
How you doing, bro?

00:14:10.010 --> 00:14:12.760
Hello me! Five years ago, you were still part of me.

00:14:13.850 --> 00:14:17.310
Who do you think put in the effort to make you so good with a gun?

00:14:17.310 --> 00:14:20.060
It wasn't you. It was me.

00:14:20.810 --> 00:14:24.770
You inherited all my memories and abilities.

00:14:26.440 --> 00:14:29.030
Did you forget everything?

00:14:29.030 --> 00:14:32.700
Five years ago, you were just a single cell.

00:14:33.490 --> 00:14:38.620
Thanks to us, you've become a magnificent soldier.

00:14:38.620 --> 00:14:40.790
You should be grateful.

00:14:42.330 --> 00:14:44.620
After that, you successfully infiltrated the Haniwa,

00:14:44.620 --> 00:14:50.170
and succeeded in your mission to bring Kuro here once he'd appeared.

00:14:50.170 --> 00:14:52.970
I'm so emotional right now!

00:14:53.420 --> 00:14:55.890
You've developed well!

00:14:55.890 --> 00:14:57.390
Congratulations, Kuon!

00:14:57.680 --> 00:14:59.560
My beloved brother!

00:15:11.230 --> 00:15:13.570
That's why this pains my heart.

00:15:16.030 --> 00:15:19.120
It feels like I'm killing myself.

00:15:38.140 --> 00:15:40.760
So, this is where you were.

00:15:41.680 --> 00:15:43.520
Is this Kuon?

00:15:44.180 --> 00:15:48.270
Yes. He's the specimen you've been waiting for.

00:15:58.410 --> 00:16:02.620
He bears quite a resemblance...

00:16:03.540 --> 00:16:05.460
to him.

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:21.930
All that remains is to bring him here.

00:16:21.930 --> 00:16:26.430
That's right. That's our top priority.

00:16:26.430 --> 00:16:30.650
For both you and me alike.

00:16:32.650 --> 00:16:33.940
Indeed.

00:17:02.850 --> 00:17:05.510
If you desire Kuromitsu's blood,

00:17:06.640 --> 00:17:08.930
you must overcome death.

00:17:09.940 --> 00:17:13.360
You should be able to manage that much.

00:17:29.960 --> 00:17:31.460
What are your intentions?

00:17:32.290 --> 00:17:34.630
Let's put on a sideshow first.

00:17:34.630 --> 00:17:36.590
I wonder what kind of reaction we'd get...

00:17:40.170 --> 00:17:44.390
if we injected your blood into her.

00:17:44.680 --> 00:17:45.390
Rai!

00:17:50.390 --> 00:17:53.480
Do you know the vampire story, <i>Dracula</i>?

00:17:54.360 --> 00:17:58.400
It's a novel by Bram Stoker.

00:17:58.400 --> 00:18:01.990
I would like to recreate that story using your blood.

00:18:02.990 --> 00:18:09.410
I wish to confirm whether your powers are ones that can be transfered...

00:18:10.200 --> 00:18:12.750
through such a method,

00:18:12.750 --> 00:18:17.380
because I want to be the one who scribes this new legend!

00:18:18.380 --> 00:18:19.590
Stop this!

00:18:19.590 --> 00:18:21.920
She's not involved in this!

00:18:21.920 --> 00:18:26.100
That makes her a better guinea pig!

00:18:41.440 --> 00:18:49.030
The creation of a superior form of life starts now!

00:19:31.290 --> 00:19:38.250
Bastard, how dare you touch me with those filthy hands...

00:19:38.750 --> 00:19:42.130
I'll make sure you regret this!

00:20:13.120 --> 00:20:28.170
Next Chapter

00:20:18.510 --> 00:20:28.170
Endless
Struggle
